  "prefLabel": "En 1012.01 Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.01 Eligibility. An applicant shall be eligible to participate in a group study if the facility meets the criteria of En 1011.05 and once the application is deemed complete, or if the applicant and utility have not executed an IA and the utility determines that the facility is located in the common study area of another facility that has been assigned a later queue position and meets the criteria of En 1011.05.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
